your final step count determines your rank. Pull off a perfect run, and your name might just show up on the global leaderboard. Compare your stats with friends or the world. Just remember, your employer is always watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/02defdd9bbb3c8082220c8b5899d0bcd.poster.avif?t=1772801415\" width=1170 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/02defdd9bbb3c8082220c8b5899d0bcd.webm?t=1772801415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/02defdd9bbb3c8082220c8b5899d0bcd.mp4?t=1772801415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you know is the name: IPT. No faces, no meetings. Just a radio, and they talk first. You can feel something\u2019s off. But are you really ready to dig into it? Some things are better left buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you stay obedient\u2026 or resist?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/ff350b86d014996e893cfa5e1fac4a20.poster.avif?t=1772801415\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/ff350b86d014996e893cfa5e1fac4a20.webm?t=1772801415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/extras/ff350b86d014996e893cfa5e1fac4a20.mp4?t=1772801415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingenious, compact, handcrafted puzzle levels</p></li><li><p cl