_c9365ac9df75617263beefac322c77699b0334da.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772801415","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/c9365ac9df75617263beefac322c77699b0334da/ss_c9365ac9df75617263beefac322c77699b0334da.600x338.jpg?t=1772801415"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/21a4b4180cea1367d8fa4074dad5edc8176940e0/ss_21a4b4180cea1367d8fa4074dad5edc8176940e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772801415","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692620/21a4b4180cea1367d8fa4074dad5edc8176940e0/ss_21a4b4180cea1367d8fa4074dad5edc8176940e0.600x338.jpg?t=1772801415"}],"short_description":"In this pixel-art dystopian block-pushing puzzler, a shadowy client has hired you to navigate a network of hazardous secret labs. Find a way to clean the scene and destroy the \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588. Take the money, do the job, don\u2019t ask questions.","steam_appid":2692620,"support_info":{"email":"mail@smitner.studio","url":"https://smitner.studio"},"supported_languages":"English, German","type":"game","website":"https://smitner.studio"}